  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n** 3(1)/(9) ÷ (4)/(9) of ( 7 right.(3)/({10)} + 3left. {(1)/(5)} ) + (4)/(5) ÷ 2(2)/(5) **\n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/37b19436503c90202c3c96014c975348b1c81c511f47868532202a6f91509a0a.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n 3(1)/(9) ÷ (4)/(9) of ( 7 right.(3)/({10)} + 3left. {(1)/(5)} ) + (4)/(5) ÷ 2(2)/(5) \n\n⇒ 28over9 ÷ 4over9 × (73over10 + 16over5) + 4over5 ÷ 12over5\n\n⇒ 28over9 ÷ 4over9 × (73 + 32over10) + 4over5× 5over12\n\n⇒ 28over9 ÷ 4over9× 105over10 + 1over3\n\n⇒ 28over9 ÷ 420over90 + 1over3\n\n⇒ 28over9 × 90over420 + 1over3\n\n⇒ 28over42 + 1over3\n\n⇒ (28 + 14)over42\n\n⇒ 42over42\n\n⇒ 1\n\n**∴ 3(1)/(9) div (4)/(9) of ( 7 right.(3)/({10)} + 3left. {(1)/(5)} ) + (4)/(5) div 2(2)/(5) is 1**\n\ncd",
